## Managing pain

- start painkillers early, as soon as pain begins
- use heat pads or a hot water bottle
- gentle exercise, stretching or yoga may help

## Fatigue

Pace yourself, plan rest, and be kind to yourself on bad days.

## Sex and relationships

Pain during sex is common. Talk to your partner, try different positions, and speak to your doctor, as help is available.

## Mental health

Living with pain and a long wait for diagnosis can be very hard. Talk to your GP if you feel low or anxious.

## Support

**Endometriosis UK** has a helpline, online community and local support groups.
